  <section class="sec" id="approche">
    <div class="wrap approach">
      <div class="approach-copy reveal">
        <div class="slabel">Why get involved</div>
        <h2>Qualified talent, <span class="grad">held back by a lack of network</span></h2>
        <p>Every year, international students who graduate in France struggle to land a first internship or a first job.</p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>No professional network in France</li>
          <li>Unfamiliar recruitment codes</li>
          <li>A first work experience still to build</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="encart">
          <p><strong>The obstacle is not skills, it is access.</strong></p>
        </div>
        <p>Our role is to connect this talent with companies that want to recruit differently.</p>
        <p>We chose to go further. <strong>Every partnership comes with a traceable environmental contribution</strong>, carried out with Tree-Nation.</p>
        <p>Credible social commitment goes hand in hand with the environment, not alongside it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-points reveal">
        <div class="mission-points">
          <div class="mp"><div><h3 class="mp-t">Candidates trained in France</h3><p class="mp-d">International students and recent graduates from a wide range of programmes and levels, from internships to first jobs.</p></div></div>
          <div class="mp"><div><h3 class="mp-t">Intercultural skills</h3><p class="mp-d">Candidates who are often multilingual and used to working across several cultures and work environments.</p></div></div>
          <div class="mp"><div><h3 class="mp-t">Support before they reach you</h3><p class="mp-d">With reviewed CVs and interview preparation, candidates arrive better prepared.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

