  <section class="sec alt" id="collaborateurs">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center reveal">
        <div class="slabel">Employee engagement</div>
        <h2>What if your employees’ social commitment became <span class="grad">your proudest shared achievement?</span></h2>
        <p>A few hours given by one employee can change a student’s path. With Imizi Links, your teams share their expertise with international students and recent graduates, within a clear framework and with a report in figures at the end.</p>
      </div>
      <h3 class="sub-head reveal">Five ways to involve your teams</h3>
      <div class="steps missions reveal">
        <article class="step">
          <p class="step-n">2 hours</p>
          <h4>Mock interview</h4>
          <p>For recruiters and managers.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <p class="step-n">3 to 4 hours</p>
          <h4>CV and LinkedIn workshop</h4>
          <p>For HR and talent acquisition teams.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <p class="step-n">2 hours</p>
          <h4>Panel discussion on recruiting international talent</h4>
          <p>For HR teams and executives.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <p class="step-n">2 hours a month, over 6 to 12 months</p>
          <h4>Mentoring</h4>
          <p>For managers and subject-matter experts.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <p class="step-n">2 to 4 hours</p>
          <h4>Career workshop or themed afterwork (AI, cybersecurity and more)</h4>
          <p>For experts and business leads.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="prise-en-charge reveal">
        <h3 class="sub-head">What Imizi Links takes care of</h3>
        <p>We scope the mission with your CSR or HR team, we select students based on their study and career plans, never on their origin, and we handle the logistics.</p>
        <p>After each action, you receive a report in figures with the hours given, the employees involved and the students supported. Missions can take place during working hours if your company allows it, or in the employee’s own time. No hiring commitment is required.</p>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-modal="partenariat">Suggest a mission</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" id="impact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center reveal">
        <div class="slabel">Our double impact</div>
        <h2>A <span class="grad">social</span><br>and <span class="grad-eco">environmental impact.</span></h2>
        <p>Two dimensions rarely brought together in a single partnership with an association, and that is exactly what makes ours valuable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="duo reveal">
        <div class="duo-card social">
          <small>Social impact</small>
          <h3>Opening up access to work</h3>
          <p>We support qualified people who are held back not by their skills but by a lack of network.</p>
          <div class="duo-list">
            <div class="duo-item"><p>A community member joining you for an internship, an apprenticeship or a job, with our follow-up before and after they start.</p></div>
            <div class="duo-item"><p>Your job offers shared with a targeted, well-prepared community.</p></div>
            <div class="duo-item"><p>Your employees involved in mentoring and career workshops.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="duo-card eco">
          <small>Environmental impact</small>
          <h3>Plant, track, share</h3>
          <p>Every partnership comes with an environmental contribution carried out with Tree-Nation, namely one traceable tree planted for each action we agree on together.</p>
          <div class="duo-list">
            <div class="duo-item"><p>One tree planted for each action agreed together, whether a hire, a mentoring programme or a workshop.</p></div>
            <div class="duo-item"><p>One tree linked to a concrete social step forward, such as a partnership or a hire.</p></div>
            <div class="duo-item"><p>A public forest, identifiable projects and planting certificates you can access.</p></div>
            <div class="duo-item"><p>Planting funded and managed by Imizi Links.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

